think r1 landed and sent — the fake net runs the real Mycelium supply law, its money moving only by the genesis keeper. The exploration doc named r2 plainly: a star_reserve fact reserves a star name under the sovereign, draining supply like tax, mirroring the harness's r2 topology settlement, so the ledger and the address space grow together inside the fake net. Agent-doable, reaches no custody gate.
think mycelium/fold.rye already carries kind_star_reserve with its own law: a reservation carries a positive myc price and a non-empty star name (else mint_fact returns null), the fold enforces uniqueness (star_taken -> StarTaken) and drains supply like tax (amount > supply -> Overdraw). So r2 is a thin, honest composition: reserve_star mints a sovereign-signed star_reserve fact and admits it through r1's gate. The reservation inherits both r1's sovereignty (NotSovereign) and the fold's own StarTaken/Overdraw refusals.
think Wrote r2 as its own file composing r1's public API (open_ledger · admit · NetLedger), exactly as the harness's constel_net_topology.rye (r2) composes constel_net.spin_up (r1). r2 needed the sovereignty gate, which r1 kept private (signer_is_sovereign); added a pub reader signer_is_sovereign_of to r1 that is the exact same private gate admit uses (asserted, so one authority test never drifts into two) — the tree's own "r1 grew only a pub reader" additive pattern. r1 re-runs GREEN at r2's door.
obs Landed pond/apps/constel_net_ledger_stars.rye + tools/constel_net_ledger_stars_witness.rish + a pub signer_is_sovereign_of in constel_net_ledger.rye. Selftest GREEN first pass (4 cases): issue 100 then reserve vega(30)+rigel(20) drains supply to 50 over three sovereign facts · a second reservation of vega refuses StarTaken whole (supply held at 70, log untouched) · a reservation priced 999 over a supply of 40 refuses Overdraw (supply held at 40) · an alien signer's reservation refuses NotSovereign before the log (only the sovereign's issue stands). The witness re-runs r1 GREEN at its door; tame_style_check bans clean, width-check exit 0.
obs Reaches no custody gate: the fold is a supply model, not a payment rail (gate #3), no real key/funds/network (gate #4). Two full signed rounds sent this turn (r1, r2), each its own increment on both remotes (origin + xykj61).
